    "content_units": [
      {
        "id": "u1",
        "kind": "CONCEPT",
        "label": "Why atomic radius cannot be measured directly for an isolated atom",
        "attributes": {
          "depth": "explanation"
        },
        "subtopic_ids": [
          "s1"
        ],
        "rationale": "Explains why an isolated atom's radius cannot be measured directly due to the lack of a sharp boundary in the electron cloud, necessitating measurement in a bonded state.",
        "review_flags": [],
        "contextualization": {
          "value": "none",
          "evidence": []
        },
        "passages": [
          {
            "id": "p1",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "social"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "नमस्ते! आज हम केमिस्ट्री का एक बहुत ही महत्वपूर्ण और आसान टॉपिक समझेंगे – **Covalent Radius (सहसंयोजक त्रिज्या)**।",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 114
          },
          {
            "id": "p2",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "इसे समझने से पहले एक छोटा सा सवाल: *क्या हम किसी एक अकेले एटम (परमाणु) की त्रिज्या को स्केल रखकर नाप सकते हैं?* ",
            "start": 116,
            "end": 228
          },
          {
            "id": "p3",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "जवाब है—**नहीं!** क्योंकि एटम बहुत छोटा होता है और उसके चारों तरफ जो इलेक्ट्रॉन का बादल (electron cloud) होता है, उसकी कोई पक्की सीमा (sharp boundary) नहीं होती।",
            "start": 229,
            "end": 390
          },
          {
            "id": "p4",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "इसलिए, हम एटम का साइज तब नापते हैं जब वह किसी दूसरे एटम के साथ जुड़ा (bonded) होता है। आइए इसे आसान भाषा में समझते हैं।",
            "start": 392,
            "end": 511
          },
          {
            "id": "p5",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "separator"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "---",
            "start": 513,
            "end": 516
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "The explanation accurately identifies the wave nature / probability cloud of electrons preventing sharp atomic boundaries.",
          "errors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "u2",
        "kind": "CONCEPT",
        "label": "Definition and mathematical formula of covalent radius",
        "attributes": {
          "depth": "statement"
        },
        "subtopic_ids": [
